## Git Workflow

### Workflow Tier: [Simple | Standard | Enterprise]

<!-- DELETE the tiers you are NOT using -->

#### Simple Tier (main only)

```
main branch → commit directly → production
```

```bash
# Daily development
git checkout main
git pull origin main
git add . && git commit -m "[type]: [description]"
git push origin main
```

#### Standard Tier (main + dev)

```
dev branch → commit directly → staging
     ↓  (PR only)
main branch → production releases
```

```bash
# Daily development
git checkout dev
git pull origin dev
git add . && git commit -m "[type]: [description]"
git push origin dev

# Release to production
gh pr create --base main --head dev --title "Release v[version]"
```

#### Enterprise Tier (main + dev + feature branches)

```
feature/fix branches → (PR) → dev → (PR) → main
```

```bash
# Create feature worktree
git worktree add ../{{PROJECT_NAME}}--feature-x -b feature/x origin/dev

# After work, create PR to dev
git push -u origin feature/x
gh pr create --base dev --head feature/x

# Cleanup after merge
git worktree remove ../{{PROJECT_NAME}}--feature-x
```

